# The frames mount: the literal opaque sandbox shows its document, which posts.
tap show
clock settle
# The sandbox opens: the literal and the bound `data:` sources show and post.
tap flip
clock settle
# Empty sandbox keeps the URL and reloads with scripts disabled; enabling scripts posts again.
tap restrict
clock settle
tap flip
clock settle
# It grants `allow-same-origin`: both are refused again (about:blank).
tap flip
clock settle
